          "text": "Aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba omwatano guryaruga Hazarenooni eri ahagati ya Hauraani na Damasiko, guryende aha rubaju rwa Yorudani ahagati ya Gileadi n'ensi ya Israeli, guhikye aha nyanja y'oburugwa-izooba, gugumizemu guhikye Tamari. Ogwo nigwo mwatano gw'oburugwa-izooba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
